<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-SWISS GRAND PRIX RESULT.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-SWISS GRAND PRIX RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the 232-km</p>
<p>Swiss Grand Prix World Cup cycling race on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Andrea Ferrigato (Italy)   5 hours 51 minutes 52 seconds</p>
<p>2. Michele Bartoli (Italy)</p>
<p>3. Johan Museeuw (Belgium)</p>
<p>4. Lance Armstrong (U.S.)</p>
<p>5. Francesco Casagrande (Italy)</p>
